WEBVTT

00:07:57.306 --> 00:08:00.059
Or it can be about a different
topic entirely,

00:08:00.059 --> 00:08:02.520
like religion or identity.

00:08:03.103 --> 00:08:04.647
Whatever this topic may be,

00:08:04.688 --> 00:08:09.193
just talk about something
that’s uncomfortable, unconventional

00:08:09.235 --> 00:08:10.945
and meaningful to you.

00:08:10.945 --> 00:08:12.112
And most importantly,

00:08:12.154 --> 00:08:15.032
do it with the intent to listen and learn,

00:08:15.074 --> 00:08:17.076
not to win and not to agree.

00:08:17.701 --> 00:08:19.495
And you know, another tip.

00:08:19.537 --> 00:08:23.082
Make sure to stay off of your phone
for this conversation.

00:08:23.791 --> 00:08:24.959
Yeah.

00:08:25.584 --> 00:08:28.796
You know, as someone
who's pretty much obsessed with TikTok,

00:08:28.837 --> 00:08:32.758
I completely understand how addicting
social media can be.